cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DBMS-Benchmarker, please cite the software version you used and the article below."
type: software
title: "DBMS-Benchmarker"
abstract: >-
  DBMS-Benchmarker is a Python-based application-level blackbox benchmark tool
  for Database Management Systems (DBMS). It connects to a given list of DBMS
  via JDBC and runs a given list of parametrized and randomized (SQL) benchmark
  queries. Evaluations are available via a Python interface, in reports and in
  an interactive multi-dimensional dashboard.
